                                "sense_id": "c7449f01-7180-3463-a291-29a7c9598f9d",
                                "text": "A babbie robbed of her mam and da and two sets of families grieving."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fca72ec0-31f0-482a-965b-2782a98a108a",
                                "sense_id": "c7449f01-7180-3463-a291-29a7c9598f9d",
                                "text": "So even though I was greetin like a babbie the day my auntie Edie came tae take me away, and my ma was – what's it? incon-soul-able – I think it was the best thing fur wur family."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d5b1343-80dd-4bc4-8f4a-5821a137b568",
                                "sense_id": "c7449f01-7180-3463-a291-29a7c9598f9d",
                                "text": "That she was granen—in the way of a babbie coming. And she hardly more than a babbie herself."
